{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":16.08},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.68,"end":31.44},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.2,"end":44.72}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.92,"text":"模擬器用有限時間步長更新位置與速度。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.44,"end":7.84,"text":"路徑只是連續方程式的近似，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.187,"end":11.28,"text":"因此數值漂移不是新的物理現象。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.92,"end":16.08,"text":"能量和整體軌道形狀能幫助我們檢查計算結果。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.68,"end":18.96,"text":"執行近圓軌道案例，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.36,"end":21.6,"text":"暫停並檢查路徑。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.16,"end":24.08,"text":"以相同參數重新開始，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.48,"end":26.72,"text":"觀察哪些特徵可以重現。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.08,"end":31.44,"text":"逐漸出現的人為能量漂移可能表示什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.2,"end":36.64,"text":"逐漸出現的人為能量漂移可能表示什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.16,"end":41.76,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.24,"end":44.72,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}